Shyamalan decided to adapt Sandcastle into a film after
receiving it as a Father's Day gift in 2017.

16
01:18:32,727 --> 01:18:38,727
The untitled project was announced in September 2019, with the
filmmaker revealing a partnership with Universal Pictures.

17
